# Old thehealingbench.ca (Wix) URLs. The new build is one HTML document with in-page anchors
# (#hero #intro #practitioners #treatments #fees #visit #reviews #faq #book), so there is no
# same-named page left to redirect to. Each old URL 301s to the closest matching anchor
# instead of 404ing. Test every line with curl -sI after deploy.
/about-us                          /#intro       301
/services-1                        /#treatments  301
/services-2                        /#treatments  301
/fees                               /#fees        301
/book-online                        /#book        301
/service-page/express-massage       /#treatments  301
/service-page/full-body-massage     /#treatments  301
/service-page/deep-tissue-massage   /#treatments  301

# Wix's own empty placeholder pages. They never held real content, so there is no closest
# section to send them to; they go to the home page instead.
/blank    /  301
/blank-1  /  301
/blank-2  /  301
/blank-3  /  301

# Do not rely on a 200 rewrite to / or /index.html: on Pages that comes back as a 308 to /.
# The www to apex redirect is a Cloudflare Redirect Rule in the dashboard, not a line here.
